@startuml 06-payment-reconciliation
title Domain Story 6 — Captured Payment with Failed Order Creation
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "B2B Buyer" as Buyer
participant Payment
participant "Payment Provider" as Provider
participant "Sales Commitment" as Sales
participant Operations

Buyer -> Payment : Start prepaid online checkout
Payment -> Provider : Obtain provider authorization/capture
Provider --> Payment : Provider result
Payment -> Sales : Request final Sales Order creation
alt Sales Order creation fails after capture
  Sales --> Payment : Failure
  Payment -> Payment : Record UNALLOCATED / RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED
  Payment -> Provider : Attempt automatic refund
  alt refund failure
    Provider --> Payment : Failure / uncertain result
    Payment --> Operations : Open visible reconciliation work
  end
else Sales Order creation succeeds
  Sales --> Payment : Confirmed order boundary
end

note over Payment,Operations
Provider behavior stays behind an adapter. Financial history is never erased.
end note
@enduml
